# Courses became a section of the site on 2026-10-01: /course/ moved to /courses/<course>/. The old lessons index
# goes to the course page (the course has no lessons index), each old lesson to its new path (the last rule). The
# proof-of-concept lesson's new-path twin is a tiny redirect page (public/courses/the-hidden-curriculum/lessons/poc-00-01-the-hidden-curriculum/).
/course /courses/the-hidden-curriculum/ 301
/course/ /courses/the-hidden-curriculum/ 301
/course/index.html /courses/the-hidden-curriculum/ 301
/course/lessons /courses/the-hidden-curriculum/ 301
/course/lessons/ /courses/the-hidden-curriculum/ 301

# Posts moved from /posts/<slug>/ to /ledger/<slug>/ when the site took on the tea house design. AO-004 and AO-005
# were syndicated under the old paths, so these stay forever. :slug is one segment, without its slash, so a path two
# of these rules match goes to the same place by either, and each old URL takes one hop whichever rule Cloudflare
# tries first (on the live site a /posts/* wildcard beat the /posts/:slug rule above it).
/posts /ledger/ 301
/posts/ /ledger/ 301
/posts/:slug /ledger/:slug/ 301
/posts/:slug/ /ledger/:slug/ 301
/posts/:slug/* /ledger/:slug/:splat 301
/course/lessons/* /courses/the-hidden-curriculum/lessons/:splat 301
